AccountValuationProvenanceOut.description:
Sanitized source metadata for one immutable valuation observation.

Provider account locators and raw balance values remain out of this lookup;
the performance receipt already carries the value used by the equation.

EquityFractionV1.description:
The SC-3 versioned Positioning fact (PRD §7.2).

``equity_fraction`` is a FRACTION in [0, 1] (``unit`` says so explicitly);
None when the denominator is zero or there is no data — never silently 0.
